(text "Secure element: NXP SE050C2 (I2C0 GP8/9, switchable VCC)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 125 35 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "51019830-55d8-5102-81f9-5092b8d071a1"))
(text "USB-C: power + data (R3/R4 DNP = charge-only)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 255 35 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d1d339e0-6082-52b1-a82b-5a08624045fc"))
(text "Battery, charger, load-sharing, hard power switch" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 385 35 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "708cb31b-b16c-5c46-8745-72f2909cfeb0"))
(text "microSD (SPI0 GP0-3), power-gated" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 125 205 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ba0cfe9b-d896-5207-8681-5d79b2542750"))
(text "Display: 2.0in ST7789 IPS module (SPI1 GP26/27)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 255 205 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ae99ca47-c757-5b4a-96d1-b354b8ab168d"))
(text "Buttons (active low, external pull-ups: immune to RP2350-E9)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 385 220 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ab3a0db0-dda5-5663-a208-2189c3f11749"))
(text "Debug: SWD Tag-Connect + test points (prototype only)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 300 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "64e20940-f02f-594e-abf5-e6e058de2437"))
(text "Mechanical" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 255 320 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c74d8467-3e99-5ff8-8b3d-add794684c09"))
(text "SECURITY NOTES" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 255 360 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4d001704-fa7b-5f90-bbb0-ff349770f0cb"))
(text "1. Seed is never stored in plain form: Pico flash (W25Q) is external and readable by desoldering." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 255 365 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ee371ae8-180d-5fc8-a345-defa09dddd52"))
(text "2. SE VCC switched by Q2 (default off; reset = power cycle). Use SE050 Platform SCP03 (encrypted I2C) - own keys, rotated from NXP defaults." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 255 370 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "351f5cfa-455b-562c-bccd-22bd03d1a511"))
(text "3. No test points on SE_SDA/SE_SCL on purpose. SWD: Pico underside pads only, disabled via OTP in production." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 255 375 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ab7d0449-c067-5052-8ec4-a39b98af42a7"))
(text "4. R3/R4 DNP = charge-only USB (removes USB attack surface; updates via signed image on microSD)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 255 380 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "014bebc0-f471-5610-9db4-976a5922aa04"))
(text "5. microSD is untrusted input: separate SPI bus (SPI0; display on SPI1), power-gated by Q3, unpowered unless needed." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 255 385 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "51a93a3c-1028-58d7-8c48-55e4b2bffd93"))
(text "6. SW1 pole B grounds 3V3_EN: device is fully off even with USB attached; charging still works." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 255 390 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e397dd79-4e2f-5fe3-8b98-da5000e80ad1"))
